  "description": [
    "Initialization: Assign tasks (ascending ID) to satellite with most feasible candidates; ",
    "tie-break by least assigned duration, then smaller ID. Unassigned if no candidates.\n\n",
    "Reassignment (unscheduled tasks by descending reward, then task ID):\n",
    "- Migration: Test non-owner satellites with candidates (ascending satellite ID).\n",
    "- Swap: After migrations exhaust, test task pairs (ascending task IDs) with distinct owners ",
    "and mutual candidates.\n",
    "- Acceptance: Require feasibility and strictly higher profit; restart from Migration.\n",
    "- Termination: Move exhaustion or budget limit."
